 GetNamedRange←{
     ⍝ ⍵ ←→ Range Name [Sheet Name]
     ⍝ ⍺ ←→ Worksheets ←→ result of GetSheetData or GetEntireWorkbook
     ⍝ Sheet name only needs to be provided if the range name
     ⍝ is worksheet scoped rather than globally scoped.
     500+⍳100::ReSignal ⎕DMX
     (rn sn)←2↑(⊆⍵),⊂''
     s←,⍺
     i←⊃s.WorkbookInfo
     b←⊃¨sn∘⍷¨i.DefinedValues
     (dn dv)←b∘/¨i.(DefinedNames DefinedValues)
     ~(⊂rn)∊dn:500 Signal'Name not found'
     v←dv⊃⍨dn⍳⊂rn
     ~(∧/'!$'∊v)∧~∧/'()'∊v:501 Signal'Name does not define a range'
     n a←(~⌽<\⌽v='!')⊆v
     c r←↓⍉2 2⍴a⊆⍨~a∊'$:'
     k←{(⊃⍵)+⍳1+-/⌽⍵}
     ci←k{26⊥⎕A⍳⍵}¨c
     ri←k ¯1+1⊃⎕VFI∊' ',¨r
     ~(⊂n)∊s.SheetName:502 Signal'Worksheet not found'
     ws←s⊃⍨s.SheetName⍳⊂n
     ~ws.HaveEntireSheet:503 Signal'HeaderRows (or other) not 0'
     ntbs←{(+/∨\' '≠⌽⍵)↑¨↓⍵}
     ⍉↑ntbs¨{⍵[ri;]}¨ws.Data[ci]
 }
